# 📱 SMS OTP Authentication (Email Fallback)

Always offer an alternative — SMS OTP — for users who cannot receive email reliably. The logic is simple: **if a user has no email, fall back to their phone number and send an OTP via SMS.**

---

## 🔁 Authentication Flow

```
User enters credentials
        │
        ▼
  Has Email? ──YES──► Send Email OTP ──► Verify ──► Access Granted
        │
       NO
        │
        ▼
  Has Phone? ──YES──► Send SMS OTP ──► Verify ──► Access Granted
        │
       NO
        │
        ▼
  Show Error: "No contact method available"
```

